# forge-01 nightly Forgejo backup credentials.
# Root-owned, 0600. forge-01 deliberately has NO Doppler token and must not get
# one; this file is the only place these values live on the box. Mirrored in
# Doppler (grotap prd+dev) as WASABI_FORGE_ACCESS_KEY_ID /
# WASABI_FORGE_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY / WASABI_FORGE_BUCKET.
#
# The two values below belong to the scoped Wasabi sub-user "forge-backup",
# PROVISIONED 2026-09-15 under customer-managed policy
# arn:aws:iam::100000470445:policy/ForgeBackupWrite. It could not be created
# programmatically -- the Doppler Wasabi key is itself a sub-user
# (platform-backup-agent) without IAM rights -- so it was made in the console.
#
# The policy grants FIVE actions on grotap-forge-backups, not the three an
# earlier draft of this file named:
#   s3:ListBucket, s3:GetBucketLocation, s3:PutObject, s3:GetObject
#   s3:ListMultipartUploadParts, s3:AbortMultipartUpload
# The last two are not optional. The archive is ~142 MB and boto3's upload_file
# switches to multipart above 8 MB, so without abort rights a FAILED transfer
# errors AccessDenied and leaves billable orphan parts behind forever -- a
# credential scoped too tightly turns a transient network fault into a slow
# storage leak nobody is watching.
#
# s3:DeleteObject is deliberately WITHHELD, so a compromised forge-01 cannot
# erase its own backup history. The consequence is that retention pruning in the
# bucket has to be done from an allowed host with a stronger key, never from the
# box. Verified at provisioning: DeleteObject returns AccessDenied, and
# head_bucket against platform-backups / grotapsourcecode / grotap-dr-backups
# returns 403/403/400 -- the blast radius really is this one bucket.
#
# If these are ever reset to a placeholder, forge-backup.sh still dumps and
# verifies correctly and exits non-zero at the upload stage with an explicit
# "still the placeholder" message rather than failing silently.
WASABI_ACCESS_KEY_ID=REPLACE_ME
WASABI_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=REPLACE_ME
WASABI_ENDPOINT=https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com
WASABI_REGION=us-west-1
WASABI_BUCKET=grotap-forge-backups
S3_PREFIX=forge-01
FORGE_CONTAINER=forgejo
FORGE_DATA_DIR=/opt/forge/forgejo
BACKUP_DIR=/opt/forge/backups
